{"nodes": [{"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate", "label": "Compile-time state in RetainedModeUI (doc)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_compile_time_state_binding", "label": "Compile-time State Binding", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Which element property a @State feeds is decided at write time, so generated setters assign directly; no runtime dependency tracking, subscription, or diffing. A state change is a store plus a dirty flag. Replaces an older tracking system whose subscribe/re-track cycle was costlier and failed silently on local bindings."}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_state_macro", "label": "@State macro", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L13", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Accessor + peer macro adding private _x storage and init accessor; set and _modify call __update_x(). Requires explicit type annotation because the macro resolves spellings, not types."}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_component_macro", "label": "@Component macro", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L14", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Member + extension macro that reads body (never executes it) and emits one field per node, __build, branch machinery, mount/unmount, per-state __update methods and array mutation methods."}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_elementcatalog", "label": "ElementCatalog", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L15", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Maps which constructor/modifier argument feeds which element property; the macro resolves spellings, not types."}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_reactive_setters", "label": "UIElement+ReactiveSetters (setColor/setSize/setSpacing)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L16", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each setter knows whether it invalidates layout or only render."}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_uielementbuilder", "label": "UIElementBuilder", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L17", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Now only a type-checking surface for body plus builder for hand-written trees; no @autoclosure needed since nothing is deferred."}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_listrows", "label": "ListRows", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L18", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Row cache keyed by T.ID; memoization not reactivity - it is told what changed, never asked. Rows keep their element and own @State across reorder or remount."}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_toggledemo", "label": "ToggleDemo (example component)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L22", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_body_read_not_executed", "label": "body is read but never executed", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L44", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Body stays in source so the declarative form still type-checks; macro emits straight-line construction so elements are built exactly once."}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_generated_update_method", "label": "Generated __update_<state> method", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L59", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Guards on __context; writes argument expressions (copied verbatim with self.x -> self._x) into live node fields via reactive setters. An expression reading n states is emitted into all n update methods; redundant stores are cheaper than re-tracking."}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_node_fields", "label": "Path-named node fields (__n0, __n0_1a)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L51", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Named from statement path so they are stable and debugger-readable; nil fields for untaken branches double as the liveness check."}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_branch_swap", "label": "Branch swap (__swap / tag compare)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L66", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Compare tag; on flip build the new arm and replaceChildren - one compare, one subtree construction."}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_needsrefresh", "label": "__needsRefresh dirty flag", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L87", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "State changed while unmounted sets the flag; the next mount replays every setter."}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_modify_accessor", "label": "_modify accessor for in-place mutation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L88", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Yields storage instead of copying out and back; fires the update once after the yield returns."}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_frame_size", "label": "Frame.size (frame modifier collapse)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L82", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_state_arrays_as_collections", "label": "Collections are @State arrays", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L92", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No separate collection type; count/isEmpty reads are ordinary state reads. Trade-off: a collection can no longer be shared by reference between components; children receive rows by value and call back."}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_vlist", "label": "VList / HList", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L101", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Take items: [T]; element type T comes from the written @State annotation, hence F10."}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_array_mutation_methods", "label": "Generated array mutation methods (appendItems/insertItems/removeItems/replaceItems)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L109", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A plain assignment only says 'the array changed' and rebuilds every row; naming the operation at the call site lets generated code apply insertRow/removeRow incrementally (O(1) vs O(n))."}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_incremental_applier", "label": "Incremental applier (__items_didInsert)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L123", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "__update_items with only list lines swapped to insertRow/removeRow; non-list reads re-run their ordinary expression."}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_list_index_alignment_invariant", "label": "List index-alignment invariant", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L140", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each list's children stay index-for-index with the array; the fast path depends on it and any full setItems path restores it."}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_rowview", "label": "RowView (example row component)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L158", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_composition_over_helpers", "label": "Composition, not helper methods", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L152", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Macro cannot see inside methods, so element-returning helpers are rejected (F1); extract a @Component instead, which is also the only way to give a list row its own state."}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_diagnostics", "label": "Macro diagnostics F1-F11", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L169", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "F9 retired (strong-self leak no longer true after handlers are cleared on unmount); numbers not reused. F3 (local binding) previously failed silently under old tracking; now a compile error."}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_handler_arming", "label": "__armHandlers / __disarmHandlers", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L190", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Handlers use strong self; chain built with empty placeholder closures, real closures assigned at end of mount and after branch swap, nilled at start of unmount, so the retain cycle exists only while mounted. Hand-built trees outside @Component still leak."}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_onmount_onunmount", "label": "onMount / onUnmount hooks", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L205", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Open members of UIElement called by mount traversal, discoverable via override completion; replace user-declared mount/unmount which are macro output (F7)."}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_uicontext_frame_pipeline", "label": "UIContext update/render frame pipeline", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L211", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Order: hit-test (handlers and setters run), layout if .layout pending, render in paint order. Hit-testing before layout prevents a one-frame blink for elements mounted by onTap."}, {"id": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_testviewrenderer", "label": "TestViewRenderer.draw(in:)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L213", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate", "target": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_compile_time_state_binding", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L3", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate", "target": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_state_macro", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L13", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate", "target": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_component_macro", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L14", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate", "target": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_diagnostics", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L169", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate", "target": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_uicontext_frame_pipeline", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "MetalGraphicsLib/docs/CompileTimeState.md", "source_location": "L211", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "metalgraphicslib_docs_compiletimestate_compile_time_state_binding", "target": "metalgraphi